We have just released an open source implementation of the JSR 82
Bluetooth API for Java. At the moment we're only providing WinXP
versions of the (few) native methods. I'm posting here because

- it would be great if someone would like to produce BlueZ versions of
the native methods
- perhaps there is code in our implementation which could be useful in
other JSR 82 implementations for BlueZ

Anyhow, check out

https://sourceforge.net/projects/bluecove

Regards
Eben

